n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/SECURITY.md\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/backend/\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/config.example.yaml\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/deer-flow.code-workspace\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/docker/\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/docs/\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/extensions_config.example.json\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/frontend/\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/pr-build/\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/scripts/\n/mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/skills/", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "tool", "name": "ls", "id": "180961ad-eaa8-4f21-9ba8-978dd2b26c22", "tool_call_id": "ls:37", "artifact": null, "status": "success"}, {"content": "当前工作目录 `/mnt/user-data/workspace` 下只有一个项目：\n\n**`deer-flow/`** — 之前 git clone 下来的 DeerFlow 开源项目。\n\n它的主要子目录包括：\n- **`backend/`** — Python 后端（FastAPI + LangGraph）\n- **`frontend/`** — Next.js 前端\n- **`docker/`** — Docker 部署配置\n- **`scripts/`** — 安装/配置/部署脚本\n- **`skills/`** — 内置技能\n- **`docs/`** — 项目文档\n\n需要我帮你对这个项目做些什么吗？", "additional_kwargs": {"reasoning_content": "用户问工作目录下有什么。之前我们已经成功 git clone 了 deer-flow 项目，它位于 /mnt/user-data/workspace/deer-flow/ 下。\n\n工作目录 /mnt/user-data/workspace 下目前只有一个目录：deer-flow/，这就是之前 clone 下来的 DeerFlow 项目。\n\n我应该简洁地回答，列出主要内容。", "token_usage_attribution": {"version": 1, "kind": "final_answer", "shared_attribution": false, "tool_call_ids": [], "actions": []}}, "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "model_name": "kimi-k2.6", "system_fingerprint": "fpv0_efa43628", "model_provider": "deepseek"}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--019e1ddd-978f-75d0-af49-b8dd155721c9", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 63648, "output_tokens": 189, "total_tokens": 63837, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 62976}, "output_token_details": {}}}, {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "全面分析这个项目，帮我定位一个bug的原因："}], "additional_kwargs": {"run_id": "961edc99-2d1c-4562-a5cd