{'content': 'Review R8: after_model 竞争修复方案的风险评估', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'Review R9: Clarification 重复修复方案的风险评估', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'Review R10: @Next/@Prev 缺失修复方案的风险评估', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': '汇总输出完整维护者 Review 报告', 'status': 'completed'}]", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "tool", "name": "write_todos", "id": "6f2cd422-3183-45dd-9b2d-eff1a895d1c2", "tool_call_id": "write_todos:75", "artifact": null, "status": "success"}, {"content": "", "additional_kwargs": {"reasoning_content": "报告已经完成。让我给用户一个清晰的总结，并呈现文件。", "token_usage_attribution": {"version": 1, "kind": "tool_batch", "shared_attribution": false, "tool_call_ids": ["present_files:76"], "actions": [{"kind": "present_files", "tool_call_id": "present_files:76"}]}}, "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "tool_calls", "model_name": "kimi-k2.6", "system_fingerprint": "fpv0_efa43628", "model_provider": "deepseek"}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--019e2bd6-761a-7d13-9c2b-338bfa170245", "tool_calls": [{"name": "present_files", "args": {"filepaths": ["/mnt/user-data/outputs/middleware_fixes_maintainer_review.md"]}, "id": "present_files:76", "type": "tool_call"}], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 142643, "output_tokens": 47, "total_tokens": 142690, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 141824}, "output_token_details": {}}}, {"content": "Successfully presented files", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "tool", "name": "present_files", "id": "492ae2ca-ba14-4f30-b8fb-c0143995522b", "tool_call_id": "present_files:76", "artifact": null, "status": "success"}, {"content": "维护者 Review 报告已完成，共 **851 行**。以下是核心结论：\n\n---\n\n### 评审结果总览\n\n| 风险 | 原始方案 | 评审判定 | 核心反对理由 |\n|------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| **R1** 双入口不一致 | 统一 canonical assembly | 🔴 **Reject** | `_MockConfig` 不完整、`AppConfig.from_runtime_features` 不存在、SDK 语义破坏、与 Phase 2 目标冲突 |\n| **R2** sandbox 级联缺失 | 解耦条件分支 | 🟡 **Accept with conditions** | `sandbox=False` 时 `thread_id=None` 会抛异常，需增强容错 |\n| **R3** vision 无校验 | 新增 `model_supports_vision` | 🟡 **Accept with conditions** | heuristic 不可靠、默认行为变化，需保守默认值 |\n| **R4** LoopDetection 污染 | `additional_kwargs` 标记 | 🔴 **Reject** | 前后端必须同步部署、安全机制可能失效、深拷贝性能问题、新协议维护负担 |\n| **R5** SubagentLimit 截断 | synthetic ToolMessage | 🟡 **Accept with conditions** | 改变 `messages[-1]`，TokenUsage 和 LoopDetection 会跳过 |\n| **R6** Summarization 配对 | synthetic ToolMessage | 🔴 **Reject** | 只补 ToolMessage 不更新 AIMessage.tool_calls，产生\"多余 ToolMessage\" |\n| **R7** DynamicContext ID-swap | `_is_summary` 标记 | 🟢 **Accept** | 几乎无风险（`name=\"summary\"` 已有排除） |\n| **R8** after_model 竞争 | 三种方案 | 🟡 **Accept（仅方案3）** | 方案1 与 LangGraph 语义不兼容、方案2 全局状态竞态 |\n| **R9** Clarification 重复 | 去重逻辑 | 🟢 **Accept** | 低风险 |\n| **R10** @Next/@Prev 缺失 | 共享定位函数 | 🟢 **Accept** | 低风险，建议合并 R9 |\n\n---\n\n### 关键发现\n\n**被 Reject 的 3 项：**\n\n1. **R1（双入口统一）**：强行统一两个入口会破坏 SDK 用户的现有行为。`_MockConfig` 是技术债务，不应生产化。建议改为 **CI parity test** 在编译时发现不一致，零运行时风险。\n\n2. **R4（LoopDetection 污染）**：`additional_kwargs` 标记协议需要前后端同步部署，一旦不同步会导致 loop warning 对用户完全不可见（安全机制失效）。建议改为 **消费方过滤 content**（MemoryMiddleware、TitleMiddleware 中清除 `[LOOP DETECTED]` 前缀），零部署协调风险。\n\n3. **R6（Summarization 配对）**：当前修复只补 synthetic ToolMessage，但没有确保 AIMessage 的 `tool_calls` 列表与之匹配。建议改为 **放弃不完整的 skill rescue**（如果某个 AIMessage 的 tool calls 无法全部保留，就整个放弃 rescue）。\n\n**可立即实施的 4 项：**\n\n- **R7** `_is_summary` 标记\n- **R9** Clarification 去重\n- **R10** 共享定位函数（合并 R9）\n- **R8 方案3** warning-only 顺序验证\n\n报告文件已保存到 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/middleware_fixes_maintainer_review.md`。", "additional_kwargs": {"reasoning_content": "报告已经完整呈现。让我给用户一个清晰的总结，概述评审结果的关键发现。", "token_usage_attribution": {"version": 1, "kind": "final_answer", "shared_attribution": false, "tool_call_ids": [], "actions": []}}, "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "model_name": "kimi-k2.6", "system_fingerprint": "fpv0_efa43628", "model_provider": "deepseek"}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--019e2bd7-c50c-7372-933f-23279a6c4c1a", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 142710, "output_tokens": 769, "total_tokens": 143479, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 142592}, "output_token_details": {}}}, {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "你现在作为这个项目的维护者，基于你上面给出的报告 middleware_p0_p1_p2_bug_analysis_and_fixes.md ，评估给每个修复做review，同时每个修复都要判断系统级风险，这样修改会给当前系统带来什么样的风险和不稳定性"}], "additional_kwargs": {"run_id": "3922f666-33ae-45e5-b1f9-1a9e86d25d09", "timestamp": "2026-05-15T13:59:51.563617+00:00"}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": "user-input", "id": "397f88eb-8076-4b18-8af8-a2348db417f3"}]}}
