event: messages
data: [{"content": "851 /mnt/user-data/outputs/middleware_fixes_maintainer_review.md\n---\n# DeerFlow Middleware Bug Fixes — 维护者 Review 报告\n\n> 评审对象：middleware_p0_p1_p2_bug_analysis_and_fixes.md 中提出的 10 项修复方案\n> 评审视角：项目维护者（Production-grade, backward-compatible, regression-averse）\n> 版本基准：`ba864112` (2026-05-15)\n> 评审维度：系统级风险、向后兼容性、回归风险、性能影响、部署复杂度\n\n---\n\n## 评审方法\n\n每项修复按以下维度打分（1-5，5=风险最高）：\n\n| 维度 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **回归风险** | 修改是否可能破坏现有功能 |\n| **兼容风险** | 是否破坏 API/ABI/数据格式兼容性 |\n| **部署风险** | 是否需要前后端同步部署、数据库迁移、配置变更 |\n| **性能风险** | 是否引入额外计算、内存、IO 开销 |\n| **维护风险** | 是否增加代码复杂度、引入新的依赖假设 |\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "tool", "name": "bash", "id": "61b5c13b-1fb4-4396-98b1-8ab3e8c3849f", "tool_call_id": "bash:77", "artifact": null, "status": "success"}, {"agent_name": "default", "model_name": "kimi-k2.6", "thinking_enabled": true, "reasoning_effort": "medium", "is_plan_mode": true, "subagent_enabled": false, "tool_groups": null, "available_skills": null, "thread_id": "1aa43d59-cfdb-4cd9-a88a-3585086bd6fb", "ls_integration": "langgraph", "langgraph_step": 601, "langgraph_node": "tools", "langgraph_triggers": ["__pregel_push"], "langgraph_path": ["__pregel_push", 0, false], "langgraph_checkpoint_ns": "tools:15284c20-a481-ca23-eae5-670cd958b2bd"}]
